        "explanation": "<p>The central angle of a regular polygon is calculated using the formula $360\u00b0 / n$, where $n$ is the number of sides. For a hexagon ($n = 6$), the central angle is $360\u00b0 / 6 = <b>60\u00b0</b>.</p>",
